    "statement": "theorem actual_k1_quotient_miller_certificate : (curve.Δ≠0 ∧ Nat.card curve.Point=9 ∧ addOrderOf G=9 ∧ Nat.Prime 3 ∧ Nat.Coprime 3 7 ∧ 3 ∣ 7-1 ∧ 3^2 ∣ Nat.card curve.Point ∧ TorsionBoundaryAudit.embeddingDegree 7 3=1) ∧ (Nat.card threeTorsion=3 ∧ Nat.card Right=3 ∧ Nat.card UnitTarget=3 ∧ Nat.card cubeRoots=3 ∧ torsionHom 1≠0 ∧ toRight G≠0 ∧ ∀ U : threeTorsion,torsionToRight U=0) ∧ (∀ (U : threeTorsion) (R : curve.Point), tateValue U (toRight R)=reducedTateMiller U.val R) ∧ (∀ (U : threeTorsion) (R S : curve.Point) (h : goodAux U.val R S), (QuotientGroup.mk' baseCubes) (rawAuxUnit U R S h)=tateClass U (toRight R)) ∧ (∀ (U V : threeTorsion) (S : curve.Point), WeilAuxSupport U.val V.val S → weilAtAux U.val V.val S=1) ∧ (∀ (U V : threeTorsion) (z : Right), tateClass (U+V) z=tateClass U z*tateClass V z) ∧ (∀ (U : threeTorsion) (z w : Right), tateClass U (z+w)=tateClass U z*tateClass U w) ∧ (∀ U : threeTorsion,(∀ z : Right,tateClass U z=1) → U=0) ∧ (∀ z : Right,(∀ U : threeTorsion,tateClass U z=1) → z=0) ∧ (∀ (U V : threeTorsion) (z : Right), reducedUnits (U+V) z=reducedUnits U z*reducedUnits V z) ∧ (∀ (U : threeTorsion) (z w : Right), reducedUnits U (z+w)=reducedUnits U z*reducedUnits U w) ∧ (∀ U : threeTorsion,(∀ z : Right,reducedUnits U z=1) → U=0) ∧ (∀ z : Right,(∀ U : threeTorsion,reducedUnits U z=1) → z=0) ∧ (∀ U V : threeTorsion,weilValue U V=1 ∧ tateClass U (torsionToRight V)=1) ∧ (¬∀ U : threeTorsion,(∀ V : threeTorsion,weilValue U V=1) → U=0) ∧ (¬∀ U : threeTorsion,(∀ V : threeTorsion,tateClass U (torsionToRight V)=1) → U=0) ∧ (∀ (A : Type) [AddCommGroup A] (b : threeTorsion →+ threeTorsion →+ A), (∀ U : threeTorsion,b U U=0) → (∀ U V : threeTorsion,b U V=0) ∧ (¬∀ U : threeTorsion,(∀ V : threeTorsion,b U V=0) → U=0)) ∧ (∀ U : threeTorsion,InflectionCertificate U.val) ∧ (∃ P : geometricCurve.Point,(3:ℕ) • P=0 ∧ P ∉ Set.range basePointMap) ∧ IsPrimitiveRoot (2:F) 3 ∧ reducedTateMiller ((3:ℕ) • G) G=2",
    "decl_sha256": "cdaa83475f74e576cd16408e5148181e4b775b0bb57234a019a5cda602f4d076",
    "scope": "Actual nonsingular E/F7:y²=x³+3x+2 has rationalpointgroup cyclic9 with actual generatorG0,3/order9, rational3torsionAcard3 and true quotientB=E(F7)/3E(F7)card3. Natural A->B iszero, Gclassnonzero; actual geometric3torsion outsidebaseimage, embeddingdegree1,r3prime/coprime7/rdiv6/r²div#E9. Prescribed actual tangent/Miller expressions give rawclasses in actualF7*/cubes and reducedunit-cuberootvalues, both targets3 and actualfinalexponent2isomorphism. Full bilateralbilinearity/ND onA×B, exactMillerbridge for everyactualpoint and everyvalidTateauxiliary; allvalidWeilauxiliaries onrationalA×A give1. Both rationalrestrictionsall1 with directNDnegations; everyalternatingbiadditive map onactualcyclicA istrivial/degenerate. Actual tangent tripleintersection and localinfinitychart algebra. ConcreteT(3G,G)=2primitivecuberoot. No torsionbasis/representative/ND/Hasse/genericpairing premise. Canonicaldivisor/valuation identification andgenericMOV/FR remainopen; noqualifiedsourcerefutation, originalFR94remainsunread, no nativeexperiment or executionassurance.",
